A nested unclosed fence keeps every blank line

````
- - - ```
      x


    q
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <pre><code>x


</code></pre>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>q</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
````

